dsh-desktop (1.0.1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Pure JS Debian version comparator in update-check.
  * Guard binary symlink creation in postinst and deduplicate postrm cleanup.
  * Ensure ~/.dsh/.agent-presets directory creation on bootstrap.
  * Remove unused market-client module and break preset loopback cycle.
  * Security hardening: sanitize reason in snapshot pruning and reject symlinks in sourceDirectory.

